stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> queued
    [*] --> complete : reused from the failed attempt being continued
    queued --> writing : worker starts the request
    writing --> responding : the response starts arriving (the batch counts as half done)
    responding --> CheckCitations : structured reply received
    CheckCitations --> complete : every cited note is citable evidence
    CheckCitations --> responding : uncitable IDs, one correction request
    CheckCitations --> Failed : uncitable IDs after the correction
    complete --> [*]
